.TH SVGPRINTLAYOUT 1 "2026-10-21" "svg-print-layout 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
svgprintlayout \- lay out an SVG drawing over several sheets and export it as a PDF
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B svgprintlayout
[\fB\-lang\fR \fIlanguage\fR] [\fIfile.svg\fR | \fIproject.svgpl\fR]
.br
.B svgprintlayout
[\fB\-version\fR | \fB\-selftest\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B svgprintlayout
prepares a vector SVG document of any size for printing on several sheets of
standard paper: you choose the format, the margins and the width of the
drawing, place the cuts with the mouse, then export a single multi\-page
vector PDF. The drawing keeps a single scale and the original SVG file is
never modified.
.PP
The window has three areas: the settings on the left, the interactive preview
in the centre and the list of pages on the right. The cuts are placed, moved
and deleted with the mouse; the background of the document and of the page is
chosen with an immediate preview; each sheet can be previewed as it will be
exported. A layout can be saved as a project file (\fI.svgpl\fR) and opened
again later: it records the paper, the margins, the scale, the background and
the cuts, and the original SVG file is never modified. The export checks the
PDF it has written before putting it where you asked.
.PP
The interface is available in French, English, Spanish and German. It follows
the language of the system unless a language is chosen in the menu of the
window or with
.BR \-lang .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-lang " language"
Language of the interface for this run: \fBfr\fR, \fBen\fR, \fBes\fR or
\fBde\fR. Without it, the language chosen in the menu applies, or else the
language of the system (the variables LANGUAGE, LC_ALL, LC_MESSAGES and LANG).
.TP
.B \-version
Prints the version of the program, the platform and the versions of the
rendering libraries (librsvg, cairo), then exits. To be attached to any
problem report.
.TP
.B \-selftest
Checks that the rendering engine works on this machine: loads a built\-in SVG,
measures it, draws it, exports it as a PDF and checks that the font is
embedded. Exits with code 0 if everything works, 1 otherwise.
.TP
.BI \-ready-file " file"
Creates this file once the window is shown and the document drawn. Meant for
tests and documentation.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I project.svgpl
A layout project: the settings and the place of the SVG document, not the
document itself.
.TP
.I ~/.config/svgprintlayout/settings.json
The preferences of the user (the language of the interface). On Windows:
.IR %AppData%\esvgprintlayout\esettings.json .
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/gillesmagneville/svg-print-layout
